        "reviewStatus": "released",
        "reviewNote": "Machine content release of exact unchanged full DE/EN assessment and20/20 rubric, based on retained actual independent K6-v2/K6-v3 reviews plus actual integration-agent reading against full current e4b P. Retained review files: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-11-15/stage-plan-k3k6-current-v1/prior-review/k6-v2-content/CONTENT-REVIEW.md and curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-11-15/stage-plan-k3k6-current-v1/prior-review/k6-v3-content/CONTENT-REVIEW.md. Root actual direct-claim disposition accepted the necessary two-assessment unit successor. No human acceptance, learner trial, stored-result transfer or final integrated QA claim.",
