            "taskDemandEn": "A balance reads 203, 202, 204, 203, and 202 g for a certified 200 g reference mass; when unloaded it reads 3 g. Describe the measurement limit and deviation pattern, separate random and systematic components, assess the effects of averaging and zero adjustment, and state a bounded conclusion.",
